## 9. Handoff

  DE1: add completionProvider with trigger `&` on initialize.
  Dispatch textDocument/completion to DE2.
  DE2: new `cli/lsp_complete.oo`. Lift catalog. Filter with
  ident plus leading `&`. Return CompletionList JSON.
  HARN: `scripts/lsp_complete_smoke.oo` drives bin/ooda.
  PV2: `scripts/lsp_cursor_smoke.oo` must still print PASSED.

C emit plus gcc remains product.
